0\" height=\"100\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n<span><a href=\"/wiki/squirrel-house-33971\" title=\"Squirrel House\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"Squirrel House Stage 4\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"100\" height=\"140\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" loading=\"lazy\"></a></span>\n</p>\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"navtitle\">\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/buildings-3577\" title=\"Buildings\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Buildings</a>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<table>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td>\n<td>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260901023314\nCache expiry: 2592000\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.082 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.103 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 597/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 7249/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 1783/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 9/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 28/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0/200\nLua time usage: 0.006/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 728624/104857600 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   62.343      1 -total\n 70.26%   43.802      1 Template:Infobox\n 32.57%   20.303      4 Template:Infoicon\n 19.52%   12.171      1 Template:Navigation\n 11.76%    7.331      1 Template:AnimalSheltersMenu\n  9.45%    5.894      1 Template:NavMenu\n  4.68%    2.917     18 Template:BigIcon\n  3.15%    1.965      1 Template:Languages\n  2.92%    1.820      1 Template:PageDisplay\n  2.18%    1.357      1 Template:Clr\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key 1.43.9_prod_hayday:pcache:idhash:2723-0!sseVary=RegularPage!FandomDesktop!LegacyGalleries and timestamp 20260901